<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="fr" data-theme="dark">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8" />
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />
  <title><%= title %></title>
  <meta name="csrf-token" content="<%= csrfToken || '' %>">
  <link rel="icon" href="/favicon.ico" type="image/x-icon" />
  <link rel="stylesheet" href="/css/style.css" />
  <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Sora:wght@300;400;500;600;700;800&display=swap" rel="stylesheet" />
  <style>
    * { box-sizing: border-box; font-family: 'Sora', sans-serif; }
    body { margin: 0; background: #060d1a; color: #f1f5f9; min-height: 100vh; }
    .wrap { max-width: 720px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 32px 20px 80px; }
    .topbar { display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: space-between; margin-bottom: 26px; }
    .topbar h1 { font-size: 20px; margin: 0; }
    .topbar a.back { color: #7dd3fc; text-decoration: none; font-size: 13px; }
    .device-card { display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 14px; padding: 16px 18px; border-radius: 14px; border: 1px solid rgba(3,92,128,.18); background: #0f172a; margin-bottom: 10px; }
    .device-card.current { border-color: rgba(34,197,94,.4); background: rgba(34,197,94,.05); }
    .device-icon { width: 40px; height: 40px; border-radius: 10px; background: rgba(3,92,128,.15); display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; font-size: 18px; flex-shrink: 0; }
    .device-info { flex: 1; min-width: 0; }
    .device-name { font-size: 14px; font-weight: 700; }
    .device-name .tag { font-size: 10px; font-weight: 700; color: #22c55e; background: rgba(34,197,94,.15); padding: 2px 7px; border-radius: 6px; margin-left: 8px; text-transform: uppercase; }
    .device-meta { font-size: 11px; color: #64748b; margin-top: 3px; }
    .device-actions { display: flex; gap: 6px; flex-shrink: 0; }
    .btn-sm { padding: 7px 11px; border-radius: 8px; border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.1); background: transparent; color: #94a3b8; font-size: 11px; font-weight: 700; cursor: pointer; }
    .btn-sm.danger { border-color: rgba(248,113,113,.35); color: #f87171; }
    .btn-sm.danger:hover { background: rgba(248,113,113,.1); }
    .btn-sm:hover { background: rgba(255,255,255,.05); }
    .empty { text-align: center; padding: 40px 10px; color: #64748b; font-size: 13px; }
    .intro { font-size: 12px; color: #94a3b8; line-height: 1.6; margin-bottom: 20px; }
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="topbar">
      <h1>🖥️ Appareils connectés</h1>
      <a class="back" href="/mail">&larr; Retour</a>
    </div>
    <p class="intro">
      Voici tous les appareils actuellement connectés à ton compte. <strong>Retirer</strong> déconnecte
      l'appareil (il pourra se reconnecter avec le bon mot de passe). <strong>Bloquer</strong> l'empêche
      définitivement de se reconnecter, même avec le bon mot de passe.
    </p>
    <div id="devices-list"><div class="empty">Chargement…</div></div>
  </div>

  <script src="/js/devices.js"></script>
</body>
</html>
